# sift-datasets — forensic evidence images (fetched out-of-band)
#
# Disk/memory images run to many GB and exceed GitHub's 100MB file limit,
# so ignore everything here by default. Keep the folder, this file, and any
# docs/manifests so the dataset layout stays documented in the repo.

*

!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!README*
!*.md
!manifest*.json
!*.sha256
